{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:38 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:38 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:38 2026-11-04 HKT</p><p>今 （4日）早上9時24分，青葵公路往九龍方向，一部私家車與一部警察電單車相撞，交通警墮地手腳擦傷，清醒送院。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"肇事私家車停路旁待查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60660b80c306f355a2c25f6fbe962f18/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_53.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車左車尾遭撞毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04668603e03efbe5924589d3182abc66/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/517717ab047029d154c7b7ca496e0318/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_48.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員電單車輕微損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ffbd6fd54e297c38774e35d2c4186c4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_52.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/217c94381b8447a82379359089b2f7fc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_51_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員檢走大型綠色帆布。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e117b2cfa331f01385aadfe27e1822a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警察電單車輕微損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2f6464bf88b67ad1fa51bb6bdab4c0b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_51.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6573328a77dbd7011f3c979192519fa/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_50_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車車尾損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c75553640e247733dbd607a1d71ee0a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_50_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"電單車被拖走。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7136a76b984e9ae49041e776b224157f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_39_50.jpeg\"/><p>現場青葵公路往九龍方向行車線上遺下一塊綠色帆布。事發時一部私家車駛至上址，司機發現帆布擋路，遂收慢行駛。惟尾隨的交通總部電單車收掣不及，直撞私家車車尾，交通警墮地手腳受傷。網上圖片可見當時數人在交通警員身旁協查。</p><img alt=\"交通警倒地，數人在旁協助。網上圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00ecf50fac0db60a4fb9899e5c191f2f/2026-11/ded0fc25-288c-4528-bb47-bd93deb0e724.jpg\"/><img alt=\"數名交通警事後到醫院了解同袍傷勢。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91cf2b3fad57a692833420fb7c685a4a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_21_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ce3cbd3e666dbc4d8489421f3fc5dd9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_21_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"數名交通警事後到醫院了解同袍傷勢。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b45aca277060bd8a5f5a4e019b02d50/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_20_59_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"受傷交警被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c10761e3f64d0e0e14ef45b992a21153/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_10_20_59.jpeg\"/><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，青葵公路（往九龍方向）近荔枝角公園的部份行車線仍然封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通擠塞。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:05:00.572977+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:51.998329+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:49.895709+00:00","content_hash":"745e4289d1109f84084c5f25b16a5c8293318657281057be4b26aa941cde417e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}